---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/BaseHeadBanner.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="About me page for my personal blog built with Astro."
	pubDate={new Date('February 11 2026')}
	author="Shankar Hariharan"
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<h2>Hi, I'm Shankar Hariharan 👋</h2>
	<p>
		I am a software engineer at Siemens Healthineers, working in the Magnetic Resonance (MR)
		domain. I'm part of the
		<a
			href="https://www.siemens-healthineers.com/magnetic-resonance-imaging/technologies-and-innovations/my-exam-companion"
			target="_blank"
			rel="noopener noreferrer">myExam Companion</a
		> product stack, focusing on scanner-side software that enhances MRI workflow efficiency and usability.
	</p>

	<p>
		I'm passionate about technology and enjoy solving complex, real-world problems — especially at
		the intersection of medical imaging and software engineering.
	</p>

	<h3>Primary Tech Stack</h3>
	<ul>
		<li>ASP.NET Core</li>
		<li>.NET</li>
		<li>Azure</li>
		<li>PostgreSQL</li>
		<li>WPF</li>
		<li>Complementary frontend frameworks</li>
	</ul>

	<h3>Personal Projects &amp; Exploration</h3>
	<ul>
		<li>Python</li>
		<li>React</li>
		<li>Astro</li>
		<li>Computer Vision</li>
	</ul>

	<p>
		I hold a Bachelor's degree in Electronics and Instrumentation Engineering from Vellore Institute
		of Technology (VIT).
	</p>

	<h3>Let's Connect</h3>
	<p>
		Feel free to reach out using the links below — I'd love to connect, collaborate, or exchange
		ideas.
	</p>

	<hr />

	<p><em>Thank you for visiting my page!</em></p>
</Layout>
